The owner of this repository has not yet chosen a licence. This file exists so
that the absence of a licence is explicit rather than accidental.

Until a licence is added here, all rights are reserved by the respective
authors, and no permission to copy, modify or redistribute the material is
granted beyond what applicable law allows by default.

Notes for the repository owner (this is not legal advice):

  * The repository contains different kinds of work: prose and diagrams
    (the lessons), source code (the scripts in tools/ and the code samples in
    lessons) and a source syllabus supplied by the owner
    (curriculum/source/Software_Engineering_Topics.docx). Many projects
    license prose and code separately, for example a documentation licence for
    the former and a software licence for the latter. That choice is yours.
  * When you decide: replace this file with the full licence text(s), add
    licence identifiers where appropriate, set the licence field in
    CITATION.cff, update the "Contributing and licence" section of README.md,
    and state in CONTRIBUTING.md what contributors agree to.
  * Third-party material quoted or adapted in lessons must stay compatible
    with whichever licence you choose. Lessons are written to paraphrase
    rather than reproduce external text.
